  "titulo": "Conjugate e > i verbs in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Pida, pidas, pidamos: the i stays in every form, even nosotros.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Verbs with e > i in the present keep the i in every form of the present subjunctive, nosotros included: pida, pidamos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Most stem-changing verbs (**e > ie**, **o > ue**) keep their change in the subjunctive **except in nosotros**. **E > i** verbs are different: they keep the **i** in **every form**, nosotros included."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "vestir",
            "pedir",
            "reír"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "vista",
              "pida",
              "ría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "vistas",
              "pidas",
              "rías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "vista",
              "pida",
              "ría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "vistamos",
              "pidamos",
              "riamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "vistan",
              "pidan",
              "rían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Other common verbs like this: **competir**, **repetir**, **medir**, **despedir**, **servir**, **sonreír**, **reñir**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Reír** and **sonreír** carry an accent on the **í**, except **riamos** / **sonriamos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: once **pedir** asks for an **i**, it never gives it back."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "No me sorprende que ==compitas== en la final.",
              "en": "It doesn't surprise me that you're competing in the final."
            },
